7-wei:m031-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"蒯聵","kind":"person","person_id":"n0i_g82_0n2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m031-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"陽虎","kind":"person","person_id":"hqs_i1n_n5h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m031-0019","start":19,"end":23,"surface":"衞十餘人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、並稱、匿名者、校勘或尚未定指代；不補姓名、親屬、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m031-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"簡子","kind":"person","person_id":"jg7_dpd_2ev","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m031-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"蒯聵","kind":"person","person_id":"n0i_g82_0n2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m031-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"衞人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、並稱、匿名者、校勘或尚未定指代；不補姓名、親屬、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m031-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"蒯聵","kind":"person","person_id":"n0i_g82_0n2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m031-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"蒯聵","kind":"person","person_id":"n0i_g82_0n2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m031-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"衞人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、並稱、匿名者、校勘或尚未定指代；不補姓名、親屬、闕代或成員。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","book_id":"b-shiji-037","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-037-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:p053","text":"景公十六年，魯陽虎來奔，已復去。二十五年，孔子過宋，宋司馬桓魋惡之，欲殺孔子，孔子微服去。三十年，曹倍宋，又倍晉，宋伐曹，晉不救，遂滅曹有之。三十六年，齊田常弒簡公。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m053-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m053-0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"魯陽虎","kind":"person","person_id":"hqs_i1n_n5h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id"